      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After a lot of testing, I think I found a workaround\n\n- Publish the avatar at 1/1/1 avatar scale (PC+Quest)\n\n- Go on the website and create the impostor\n\n- Public the avatar at 6/6/6 avatar scale (PC+Quest)\n\n- DON'T create an impostor\n\nThe issues seems to be generating an impostor, when the avatar isn't at 1/1/1 scale\n\nStill it's annoying, because I need to publish 4 times for 1 avi\n\nAvatar with the impostor bugged\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_b16799d5-c5f4-4928-a8a8-72daff9e7e80\n\nAvatar with the impostor working\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_004ffc79-2ef4-4e9a-9aa5-4204338d57d0",
